<title>UK: Nomura sets call warrants on Indian GDR index.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets call warrants on Indian GDR index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International said it has issued 300,000 American-style call warrants on the Nomura Indian GDR Index.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> REFEREMCE PRICE $106.0		    PREMIUM	22.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     #34.82		    GEARING	3.04 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.MAY/97-07.MAY.99   LISTING	LUX</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
